{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Rony: cámara y JetMax",
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "description": "MIRA camera, continuous telemetry and optional physical JetMax grasp cycle. Physical grasp ends at HOME with the gripper closed; object presence is unverified and no classification deposit is claimed. Physical commands are enabled only by explicit backend configuration. Local API defaults to loopback; shared deployments require authentication. Reset explicitly returns HOME and opens the gripper; it never starts a new grasp automatically."
  },
